<https://orkg.org/property/P132019> skos:exactMatch <https://orkg.org/property/P41267> ;
    owl:equivalentProperty <https://orkg.org/property/P41267> ;
    rdfs:label "The paper begins with an overview of the development theory and policy debates on the commodity-based development model and the implementation of indigenous rights. Finally, the question of whether sustainable practices of indigenous groups should be understood as an expression of their specific culture and whether these types of economic activity are relevant and realisable as models for a larger social context will be explored." .
<https://orkg.org/property/P37188> skos:exactMatch <https://orkg.org/property/P41267> ;
    owl:equivalentProperty <https://orkg.org/property/P41267> ;
    rdfs:label "The potential use of Arbuscular Mycorrhizal Fungi (AMF) as a buffer to mitigate phytoextraction of heavy metals by C. maxima from soils contaminated with crude oil in Akwa Ibom State has not been properly documented." .
<https://orkg.org/property/P37302> skos:exactMatch <https://orkg.org/property/P41267> ;
    owl:equivalentProperty <https://orkg.org/property/P41267> ;
    rdfs:label "The rate at which religious activities was practised during COVID-19 lockdown in the southwestern Nigeria does not suggest strict compliance to COVID-19 preventive measures. However, the findings of the study revealed strict compliance" .
